
@domain_anamta
Feature: Sales Invoice


@critical
Scenario: Edit Sales Invoice - Field and Grid Load Check
    Given we visit "orders/salesInvoice"
    When we clear the from date and search
    And we edit the top row
    Then the following fields should not be empty:
    | field                               |
    | orders_model_date_purchased         |
    | orders_model_labelPrint             |
    | orders_model_customers_id           |
    | orders_model_sGodownId              |
    | orders_model_trDate                 |
    | orders_model_delivery_name          |
    | orders_model_delivery_suburb        |
    | orders_model_delivery_street_address|
    | orders_model_delivery_city          |

#    And the first 1 rows in grid should be completely filled
